# Vaporhold Reservoir (CIPlay vaporhold_reservoir): the plan The Rainmakers' fifth island, quest "The Valve Tower"
# The lake (floor -7 m, r~19) in the embankment ring; the valve tower at 0 0 (platform 4 m), the glass bridge from the
# south bank (0 -21); the pump hall x 7..13 z -3..1.5 on the lake floor; the crest walk at z -29 (4.5 m).
island Vaporhold Reservoir
offset 0 33
expect step 0
expect title The Valve Tower
wait 5
expect hidden valvewheelobj
expect shown floodgate
zone embankment
expect step 1
read Surveyors' note
open Surveyors' toolbox
expect item MetalDetector 1
expect item Shovel 1
dig 0
expect story valvewheel 1
expect step 2
zone valve_tower
expect step 3
open Pump hall store
expect message flood gate is shut
use valvepost
expect story valvewheel 0
expect story valveopen 1
expect shown valvewheelobj
expect hidden floodgate
expect step 4
zone pump_hall
expect step 5
open Pump hall store
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_WaterTank 1
expect item Blueprint_Storage_Large 1
expect step 10
# RAIN 10-26: the hub, Ove Strand, the climb, Seep Cave, the secrets
expect hidden vr_rewchest
use vr_machine
expect hidden vr_rewchest
read Dam keeper's notice
expect step 11
use Ove Strand
wait 1
expect step 12
expect hidden vr_lampchest
use Survey lamp 3
wait 1
expect shown vr_lampchest
open Ove's survey case
zone vr_trail
expect step 13
zone vr_summit
expect step 14
open Survey mast deck box
wait 3
expect story vr_top 1
expect step 15
zone vr_cave
expect step 16
open Seep Cave chest
wait 3
expect story vr_cave 1
expect step 17
use vr_machine
expect shown vr_rewchest
expect story vr_fixed 1
open Outflow gate reward
wait 3
read Outflow ledger
expect step 18
# the secrets: the plane, the jumps, the set
zone vr_plane
open Survey plane's crate
read Survey pilot's note
zone vr_jumps
open Spillway perch
open Spillway top
expect hidden vr_setchest
use vr_piece1
use vr_piece2
use vr_piece3
use vr_piece4
use vr_piece5
wait 2
expect shown vr_setchest
open Survey chest
read Dagny's letter to the town
expect done
